index 74749c8..715ecca 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,3 +1,23 @@
 # app
 
 The example.com/app backend.
+
+## loga: nginx access log report
+
+`loga` reads nginx access logs in the combined format, with the request time
+in seconds as the last field. It prints totals, the top paths, status classes,
+request time percentiles, and 5xx errors per hour.
+
+```sh
+go run ./cmd/loga access.log
+go run ./cmd/loga -top 5 -json access.log.1 access.log
+cat access.log | go run ./cmd/loga
+```
+
+Flags:
+
+- `-top N`: list the N most requested paths (default 10).
+- `-json`: print the report as JSON instead of a text table.
+
+Lines that do not match the format are counted as malformed and skipped. The
+exit code is 0 on success, 1 when a file cannot be read, and 2 for bad flags.
